---
title: Hall of fame
layout: "base.pug"
---
include _includes/_mixins.pug

mixin profile(name, country, links, img)
  div.col-md-auto.mb-3.d-flex.justify-content-center: div.card(style="width: 20rem;")
    img.card-img-top(src=img alt=name+" profile picture")
    div.card-body.d-flex.flex-column
      h4.card-title #{name} #[+badge() #{country}]
      p.card-text: if block
        block
      else
        i.text-muted No description
      div.mt-auto: each link in links
        a.card-link(href=link[0]): i.fa-xl(class=link[1] ? "fab fa-"+link[1] : "fas fa-link")

section
  +sectionTitle("Hall of fame", "scroll")
  p.fs-5 People I find cool. Go follow them!
  div.row.d-flex.justify-content-center.mt-5
    +profile(
      "Linokii",
      "🇨🇦",
      [
        ["https://linokii.com"],
        ["https://twitch.tv/linokii", "twitch"],
        ["https://instagram.com/linokiiart", "instagram"],
        ["https://bsky.app/profile/linokii.com", "bluesky"],
        ["https://discord.gg/ecmGndjFp2", "discord"]
      ],
      "/img/hall-of-fame/linokii.png"
    ).
      The coolest pink deer in the hood. Definitely check them out if you like art, cute indie games, or generally having a good time!
    +profile(
      "Starless",
      "🇧🇪🇫🇷",
      [
        ["https://twitch.tv/starlessjv", "twitch"],
        ["https://youtube.com/@icistarless", "youtube"],
        ["https://instagram.com/icistarless", "instagram"],
        ["https://threads.com/icistarless", "threads"],
        ["https://tiktok.com/@icistarless", "tiktok"],
        ["https://discord.gg/DM9Gwvxf8k", "discord"]
      ],
      "/img/hall-of-fame/starless.png"
    ).
      An absolute joy to be around, and one of my biggest inspirations. If you like good food and pets, don't even think twice.
    +profile(
      "Mateous Yupio",
      "🇫🇷",
      [
        ["https://twitch.tv/mateous_yupio", "twitch"],
        ["https://youtube.com/@mateousyupio", "youtube"]
      ],
      "/img/hall-of-fame/mateous.png"
    ).
      Truly one of the Ekko mains of all time. Chronically addicted to Pokémon TCG. Seriously dude, seek help. #[sub.text-muted /j]
    +profile(
